<LanguageData>
  <!--EN: An invisibility granted by the invisibility engulfer item. This actually affects others nearby, making their brains unable to perceive the sight of this individual, even if the eyes are unaffected.-->
  <VFED_Invisibility.description>由隐形吞噬物品授予的隐形能力。这实际上会影响附近的其他人，使他们的大脑无法感知这个人的视线，即使眼睛不受影响。</VFED_Invisibility.description>
  <!--EN: invisibility-->
  <VFED_Invisibility.label>隐形</VFED_Invisibility.label>
</LanguageData>
